text PewterCity_House1_Text_TradeMonsAreFinicky {
    format("Our POKéMON's an outsider, so it's\nfinicky and hard to handle.\pAn outsider is a POKéMON that you\nget in a trade.\pIt grows fast, but it may ignore an\nunskilled TRAINER in battle.\pIf only we had some BADGES…$")
